## Academic and implementation notes

This is an academic project for Design and Analysis of Algorithms at the
National University of Computer and Emerging Sciences. Core algorithms should
be implemented and analysed by the project team; standard libraries may be
used for data handling and verification, but should not silently replace the
algorithm under evaluation. Experimental claims, plots, and conclusions should
be reproducible from the committed source and dataset.
